# um-texts 1
=== SPELL detect_life
Life Detection
Allows the target to sense all creatures within a certain radius.

=== SPELL ensorcell
Charm
The most powerful astral spell. It bewitches a creature, causing it to fall in love with the caster.

=== SPELL fireraze
Sacrifice to Fire
Deals massive damage to everyone around the caster, including the caster.

=== SPELL lichdom
Necrosis
Makes the target harder to detect by sensing life.

=== SPELL link
Link
Allows two spellcasters to link their reserves of magic energy.

=== SPELL necro
Summon Undead
Summons an undead to a specified location.

=== SPELL panic
Charisma
The target of this spell gains the ability to use more complex magic.

=== SPELL possession
Possession
Focuses the senses on a target so intensely that the caster perceives the world as the target does.

=== SPELL stench
Distortion
The target affected by this spell becomes more visible to all types of perception.

